<title>UK: M.Stanley/ABN increase Batavia asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>M.Stanley/ABN increase Batavia asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond -- launched on Wednesday -- has been increased, joint lead managers Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International (books) and ABN AMRO Hoare Govett said.</p>
<p>It has been increased to 700 million guilders from an initial 500 million guilders.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BATAVIA CREDIT CARD CORP LTD</p>
<p> AMT   *700 MLN DFL   COUPON	 6.125     MATURITY  15.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE  STRAIGHT  NEW ISSUE PRICE   101.755   PAY DATE  16.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES 2.00  NEW REOFFER PRICE 100.08    SPREAD    +35 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/CAY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    1.875     SELL CONC   0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	6.00 PCT DSL DUE JAN.06</p>
<p>		*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 500 MLN DFL ON 18.DEC.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
